value "\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\frac{6}{7}\\mathbf{a}-\\frac{1}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254227} {:answer/id #uuid "dbd9489c-6b47-566f-89ad-f4e016150b16" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\frac{5}{7}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255619} {:answer/id #uuid "e41f44f3-369d-5892-92cf-ef2145ce59f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\frac{6}{7}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255689} {:answer/id #uuid "efce3a4e-c17a-5f7a-b22e-e51a9e6f255f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\frac{3}{7}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255765}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e41f44f3-369d-5892-92cf-ef2145ce59f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\frac{6}{7}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255689} :answer-field/id #uuid "fe05e0a3-cb61-5682-9f8a-ba17656f998c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256365}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f016170a-77f5-5294-adf1-1f76e598ff0a" :question/math-academy-id "q-12214" :question/problem "![](images/42/4205d878409776be6c18735910a2f8ece019418452df83cb75d197531f057532.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=\\mathbf{a},$ $\\overset{\\to }{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$ and $T$ divides $\\overline{AB}$ in the ratio $AT:TB=1:6.$ Find $\\overset{\\to }{OT}.$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AT}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=\\mathbf{a},$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{AT}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OAB,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\\overset{\\to }{AO}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{b}-\\mathbf{a}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $AT:TB=1:6,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{AT}=\\frac{1}{7}\\overset{\\to }{AB}=\\frac{1}{7}(\\mathbf{b}-\\mathbf{a}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OT} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AT} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{7}(\\mathbf{b}-\\mathbf{a}) \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{7}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{1}{7}\\mathbf{b}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256611 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2daeb284-29df-5ff4-86cd-14507c7f2138" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OZ}=\\frac{1}{7}\\mathbf{a}-\\frac{6}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254081} {:answer/id #uuid "37587f79-1916-54d1-bd30-a1ec685778cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OZ}=\\frac{1}{7}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{6}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254149} {:answer/id #uuid "6613af7f-cd6e-5090-9ad8-c95cf72f4440" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OZ}=\\frac{2}{7}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{6}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254585} {:answer/id #uuid "7166923d-9ed4-5043-b90d-72c30975c5df" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OZ}=\\frac{2}{7}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{5}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254675} {:answer/id #uuid "8c38bebe-dc33-5286-9589-14f0ce7134d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OZ}=\\frac{2}{7}\\mathbf{a}-\\frac{5}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254911}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7166923d-9ed4-5043-b90d-72c30975c5df" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OZ}=\\frac{2}{7}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{5}{7}\\mathbf{b}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254675} :answer-field/id #uuid "b6fe2ffb-062f-5777-b082-8036f407034a" :answer-field/key "sele