\n\\overset{\\to }{AC}=\\frac{5}{6}\\overset{\\to }{AB}=\\frac{5}{6}(\\mathbf{b}-\\mathbf{a}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OC} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AC} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{5}{6}(\\mathbf{b}-\\mathbf{a}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\mathbf{a}+\\frac{5}{6}\\mathbf{b}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186294966 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8cc1233-884e-55c1-bc0b-5c72b12ac47b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293600}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a8cc1233-884e-55c1-bc0b-5c72b12ac47b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293600} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b1935e4-b1db-59ac-bdd1-af6a29d2f762" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294076} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f22b1a6-2bb1-5ce8-b04f-37229ed9ed7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293395}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6f22b1a6-2bb1-5ce8-b04f-37229ed9ed7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293395} :answer-field/id #uuid "3ea5bc20-1829-57bc-bf77-805686187035" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294146}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "02a8ac13-d9fd-5011-b248-20d1e825aecc" :question/math-academy-id "q-278263" :question/problem "![](images/c2/c26ec7e1fccc5ada4c43eef55faf9e4fa3e17ed896b1546f472edf744404da1a.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OD}=\\mathbf{d},$ $\\overset{\\to }{OE}=\\mathbf{e},$ and $F$ divides $\\overline{DE}$ in the ratio $DF:FE=2:3.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OF}$ via the vectors $\\mathbf{d}$ and $\\mathbf{e}.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OF}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\mathbf{d}+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\mathbf{e}$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OF}=\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OD}=\\mathbf{d},$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{DF}.$\n\nFirst, from $△ODE,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{DE} & =\\overset{\\to }{DO}+\\overset{\\to }{OE} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{OE} \\\\  & =-\\mathbf{d}+\\mathbf{e} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{e}-\\mathbf{d}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $DF:FE=2:3,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{DF}=\\frac{2}{5}\\overset{\\to }{DE}=\\frac{2}{5}(\\mathbf{e}-\\mathbf{d}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OF} & =\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{d}+\\frac{2}{5}(\\mathbf{e}-\\mathbf{d}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\mathbf{d}+\\frac{2}{5}\\mathbf{e}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186294974 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a88c012-40c7-570c-9b0f-c30329a43052" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OP}=\\mathbf{f}+\\frac{8}{5}\\mathbf{g}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293042} {:answer/id #uuid "32a48c96-17b1-56fa-b12d-996e52fb751e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OP}=\\frac{5}{8}\\mathbf{f}+\\frac{1}{8}\\mathbf{g}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293149} {:answer/id #uuid "6c53ad06-039f-5500-bf52-b6379b0fc1e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OP}=\\frac{5}{13}\\mathbf{f}+\\frac{8}{13}\\mathbf{g}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293384} {:answer/id #uuid "73c41839-b80f-5652-8f24-254321e8a1fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OP}=\\frac{1}{8}\\mathbf{f}+\\frac{1}{5}\\mathbf{g}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293407} {:answer/id #uuid "f362f01c-ae32-5502-bb5c-2b199e68d786" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :a