t{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{OE} \\\\  & =-\\mathbf{d}+\\mathbf{e} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{e}-\\mathbf{d}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $DF:FE=3:4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{DF}=\\frac{3}{7}\\overset{\\to }{DE}=\\frac{3}{7}(\\mathbf{e}-\\mathbf{d}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OF} & =\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{d}+\\frac{3}{7}(\\mathbf{e}-\\mathbf{d}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{7}\\mathbf{d}+\\frac{3}{7}\\mathbf{e}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302112 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8d9de2aa-4041-5f76-b6be-fe41ae2704f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300678}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8d9de2aa-4041-5f76-b6be-fe41ae2704f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300678} :answer-field/id #uuid "894293cb-5bcb-5c58-bcf1-8fa19684d17e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301658} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "115586ce-ea68-5b73-b06d-7488ecd05e55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300032}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "115586ce-ea68-5b73-b06d-7488ecd05e55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300032} :answer-field/id #uuid "cdd6dde1-aa3a-5f12-b998-fbca206e7fd2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301888}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ba11ec48-b1bc-5ad5-b2d2-084fb1f0daf5" :question/math-academy-id "q-322574" :question/problem "![](images/2a/2a9cacfc6787e60229076c4abd2854709d51ac718c8d519256a61dbe92852b05.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OG}=\\mathbf{g},$ $\\overset{\\to }{OH}=\\mathbf{h},$ and $J$ divides $\\overline{GH}$ in the ratio $GJ:JH=6:7.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OJ}$ via the vectors $\\mathbf{g}$ and $\\mathbf{h}.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\mathbf{g}+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\mathbf{h}$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\overset{\\to }{OG}+\\overset{\\to }{GJ}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OG}=\\mathbf{g},$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{GJ}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OGH,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{GH} & =\\overset{\\to }{GO}+\\overset{\\to }{OH} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OG}+\\overset{\\to }{OH} \\\\  & =-\\mathbf{g}+\\mathbf{h} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{h}-\\mathbf{g}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $GJ:JH=6:7,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{GJ}=\\frac{6}{13}\\overset{\\to }{GH}=\\frac{6}{13}(\\mathbf{h}-\\mathbf{g}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OJ} & =\\overset{\\to }{OG}+\\overset{\\to }{GJ} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{g}+\\frac{6}{13}(\\mathbf{h}-\\mathbf{g}) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{13}\\mathbf{g}+\\frac{6}{13}\\mathbf{h}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302113 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e48e2a50-28f2-5163-870b-8afa809e432c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301097}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e48e2a50-28f2-5163-870b-8afa809e432c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301097} :answer-field/id #uuid "1b3110a3-3c76-50a9-8099-660e479f8913" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301315} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fbbc76d5-fe38-5e97-a234-8280ad9d288f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301211}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fbbc76d5-fe38-5e97-a234-8280ad9d288f" :answ