 the vectors $\\mathbf{u}$ and $\\mathbf{v}.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OW}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\mathbf{u}+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\mathbf{v}$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OW}=\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{UW}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OU}=\\mathbf{u},$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{UW}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OUV,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{UV} & =\\overset{\\to }{UO}+\\overset{\\to }{OV} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{OV} \\\\  & =-\\mathbf{u}+\\mathbf{v} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{v}-\\mathbf{u}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $UW:WV=9:8,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{UW}=\\frac{9}{17}\\overset{\\to }{UV}=\\frac{9}{17}(\\mathbf{v}-\\mathbf{u}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OW} & =\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{UW} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{u}+\\frac{9}{17}(\\mathbf{v}-\\mathbf{u}) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{17}\\mathbf{u}+\\frac{9}{17}\\mathbf{v}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302116 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b8ed698-dbb6-5343-a913-fe9fb4d1817c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300090}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1b8ed698-dbb6-5343-a913-fe9fb4d1817c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300090} :answer-field/id #uuid "77c690e5-687f-5145-90a7-53ff4b4d9a45" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301598} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d2bbeecb-5f96-5ae6-a1cc-831d9c3c1e71" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{11}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301010}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d2bbeecb-5f96-5ae6-a1cc-831d9c3c1e71" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{11}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301010} :answer-fie